    "notes": "### \u2728 Features\n- Browse Apache HBase through its REST server\n- Browse Nacos configurations and TDengine\n- Browse Weaviate, Milvus and Chroma\n- Browse rqlite and libSQL / Turso, SQLite over HTTP\n- Browse Consul's key-value store and ZooKeeper znodes\n- Browse Apache Kafka topics\n- Add Solr, Qdrant, RabbitMQ, InfluxDB 3 and Prometheus\n- Browse search, wide-column, document, time-series and graph engines\n- Support 15 more databases through their own JDBC drivers\n- Support Redshift, QuestDB, OceanBase, Doris, StarRocks and Presto\n- **www:** Show how many databases TableGrip supports\n- Review pending changes before submitting, and show database logos\n- Introduce the MCP server on the website, with its docs\n- **mcp:** Let AI apps use your connections over MCP\n- **updates:** Open the updater window as soon as Check for Updates is clicked\n- Translate the interface into Vietnamese and Chinese\n- **www:** Replace hero screenshot with an animated product demo\n- **www:** Refresh landing page sections, header and theme toggle\n- Support Oracle, Firebird, Trino and YugabyteDB\n- Introduce custom AppIcons and replace existing icons in ChartView and FixView\n\n### \ud83d\udc1b Bug Fixes\n- Name ZooKeeper and Consul tabs by path, and make re-runs of the server tests repeatable\n- Size SQL editor caret to the glyphs and centre it in the line\n",
